            <note corresp="#d654-f2" n="44" xml:id="d654-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to Resolution XXI, agreed upon at the Mexico City Conference; for
                    text, see <hi rendition="#italic">Final Act of the Inter-American Conference on
                        Problems of War and Peace, Mexico City, February–March, 1945</hi>, p.
                    61.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d654-f3" n="45" xml:id="d654-f3-content">
